ated phases\u2014every break reshapes the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between sorties, the campaign shifts into clean <strong>visual-novel scenes</strong>. In combat, <strong>reactive real-time dialogue</strong>\u2014taunts, clipped orders, last words\u2014responds to wave breaks, shield timing, and boss transitions. The novel clarifies the stakes; the cockpit makes you live them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Three protagonists, one coalition</strong> \u2013 Aces from URA, EUPRA, and the Sacred Eastern Dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dual-element combat</strong> \u2013 Fire/Plasma lines with distinct tempos and applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Two shields, zero forgiveness</strong> \u2013 Fire Shield / Plasma Shield with short durations and real cooldowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Chain or be chained</strong> \u2013 Risk\u2013reward combo system that turns pressure into momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Evolving commanders</strong> \u2013 Multi-phase bosses with intentional formations and curtain fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Story in the crossfire</strong> \u2013 Real-time reactive comms in mission; visual-novel interludes between missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Decisive runs</strong> \u2013 Credits, respawns, and tuned curves that reward mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Surge moments</strong> \u2013 Power-ups and a <strong>SPECIAL overdrive</strong> to flip the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PILOTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/dc04197a9acbd2cdb